<title>USA: Spartan Motors repurchases shares.</title>
<headline>Spartan Motors repurchases shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, Mich. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spartan Motors Inc said Monday it has nearly reached the halfway point of its one million share buy-back program authorized in July 1995.</p>
<p>The chassis manufacturer said it repurchased 80,100 shares of its common stock over the last two weeks at an average price of $6.94 a share.</p>
<p>To date, Spartan said it has repurchased a total of 480,100 shares or 48 percent of the authorized shares.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
